# Keep compact, reproducible summaries and source teams in Git. Raw per-game
# results, diagnostics, and frozen model copies remain available locally.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!summary.json
!summary-console.json
!manifest.json
!results.csv
!results.txt
!results.html
!team_details.csv
!*.paste.txt
# Held-out and turf team sets (Showdown exports) and the scripts that build them, so evals are reproducible.
!*.gen1ou_team
!index.csv
!*.py
!README.md
frozen_baselines/
speed_probe/
